  fishName: Mooneel
  description: It's unclear why these eels leap out of the water at night, the act
    that gives them their name. In summer- such as it is on Boreala- swarms of hundreds
    can be seen leaping out of the water at a time, often directly into waiting Nyaalines
    nets.\n\n  Chef's notes:\nSlice thin and serve raw for optimal flavour. No sauce
    needed- the Mooneel is naturally delicious.
